course: dictionary
lesson: 15547
title: Meet the superhero
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A superhero is a character in comics, films or stories who has special powers, such as flying or great strength. «The superhero flew over the city to rescue a kitten from a tall tree.» Flying and rescuing tell you what a superhero does, so you can work out the meaning from the clues around the word.
explain: Ask yourself: what word would fit here? In the sentence, a character who flies and saves a kitten fits the word superhero. Then swap your meaning into the sentence and check that it still makes sense.
explain: Sometimes people call real people superheroes too. «Nurses are everyday superheroes» means they do brave or helpful things, even though they cannot fly. Look at the clues, such as «everyday», to see that the word is being used in a new way.
fact: A superhero is a character in comics, films or stories who has special powers.
fact: Superhero is a noun. One is a superhero, and more than one is superheroes.
fact: Superheroes often use their powers to fight evil and help people.
fact: Informally, a real person who does something very brave or helpful can be called a superhero.
fact: Useful phrases are «superhero costume» (the clothes a superhero wears) and «superhero powers» (the special abilities a superhero has).
exercise: «The superhero flew over the city to rescue a kitten.» What is a superhero? | A cat that is afraid of trees | *A character with special powers who helps people | A teacher who is very strict | A type of sandwich
exercise: What is the plural of superhero? | superhero's | *superheroes | superheros | superherous
exercise: «Nurses are everyday superheroes.» What does this mean? | People who stop trains | People who can fly | Children who wear capes | *People who do brave or helpful things in everyday life
test: «Ben's superhero costume had a red cape and a black mask.» What is a superhero costume? | A kind of food | A fast car | A school uniform | *Clothes a superhero wears
test: Which word means a character with special powers in a story? | teacher | nurse | firefighter | *superhero
exam: Dad says, «You are my superhero, Maya, for helping your brother.» What does Dad mean? | Maya can fly | *Maya did something brave or helpful | Maya has a red cape | Maya is a character in a film
